bmitted enquiry data is strictly restricted to our partners (CA Yogesh Kumar Chaturvedi and CA Saurabh Bhutada) and authorized management staff who require the information to review and respond to enquiries."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Professional Confidentiality:"}]," All personnel with access to client data are bound by professional confidentiality obligations under ICAI regulations and the firm's internal codes of conduct."]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"pt-6 border-t border-slate-100 space-y-3","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-2 text-navy-950 font-heading font-bold text-lg sm:text-xl","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 w-5 h-5 text-[#0A5084]","children":[["$","circle","gq8acd",{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"}],["$","circle","w7nqdw",{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"}],["$","circle","1xt0gg",{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"}],["$","line","47mynk",{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"}],["$","line","1n3mei",{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"D. Sharing of Personal Information"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-700 leading-relaxed","children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"We do not sell, rent, lease, trade, or monetize personal information to any third parties under any circumstances."}]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-700 leading-relaxed","children":"Information is only shared under the following strictly verified operational circumstances:"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-700","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Essential Infrastructure Providers:"}]," The web hosting provider that maintains the physical server hosting our web application and database, and the SMTP mail delivery service (Google / Gmail SMTP) utilized to transmit notification emails."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Embedded Third-Party Tools:"}]," Google Maps embedded iframes on our Contact page display our physical office premises; interacting with these maps is governed by Google's independent privacy policy."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Statutory & Legal Mandates:"}]," Personal information may only be disclosed if required by applicable Indian law, valid court order, judicial process, or formal directive from an authorized statutory regulatory authority (such as the ICAI, Income Tax Department, or GST authorities)."]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"pt-6 border-t border-slate-100 space-y-3","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-2 text-navy-950 font-heading font-bold text-lg sm:text-xl","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-clock w-5 h-5 text-[#0A5084]","children":[["$","circle","1mglay",{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"}],["$","polyline","68esgv",{"points":"12 6 12 12 16 14"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"E. Data Retention"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-700 leading-relaxed","children":"We retain submitted personal information only for as long as necessary to address your enquiry, fulfill the purpose for which it was collected, or maintain necessary records of preliminary professional communications."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-amber-50 border-l-4 border-amber-400 p-4 rounded-r-xl text-xs sm:text-sm text-amber-900","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Pending Client Confirmation:"}]," The firm's specific automated data deletion timeline and fixed archival schedule are currently under internal review to align with applicable ICAI record-retention directives and professional compliance guidelines."]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"pt-6 border-t border-slate-100 space-y-3","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-2 text-navy-950 font-heading font-bold text-lg sm:text-xl","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-cookie w-5 h-5 text-[#0A5084]","children":[["$","path","laymnq",{"d":"M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 10 10 4 4 0 0 1-5-5 4 4 0 0 1-5-5"}],["$","path","ue8clq",{"d":"M8.5 8.5v.01"}],["$","path","14dtrp",{"d":"M16 15.5v.01"}],["$","path","u5ubse",{"d":"M12 12v.01"}],["$","path","1hyl5a",{"d":"M11 17v.01"}],["$","path","uct60s",{"d":"M7 14v.01"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"F. Cookies and Website Tracking"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-700 leading-relaxed","children":"Our website is designed with a privacy-first approach:"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-700","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"No Advertising or Tracking Cookies:"}]," We do not deploy third-party advertising cookies, behavioural trackers, marketing pixels, or external web analytics tools (such as Google Analytics)."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Regulatory Local Storage:"}]," We use standard browser local storage (",["$","code",null,{"children":"localStorage"}],") solely for a single regulatory function: recording whether you have acknowledged our mandatory ICAI Regulatory Disclaimer popup (",["$","code",null,{"children":"ykcca_disclaimer_accepted"}],"), so you are not repeatedly prompted on subsequent visits."]}